          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Right_banner.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Cushioned Support with Every Step</strong>",
            "text": "<p>The terry loop bottom is designed to act as a soft shock absorber, cushioning every step and reducing impact on hard surfaces. Its thick, looped fabric provides extra comfort and support while helping ease pressure on your feet. Ideal for daily wear or sports activities, it enhances overall comfort and keeps your feet feeling supported all day long.<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_fqLxa6": {
          "type": "row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/H4a1d396b8a0845e99446c33ec8f4557cP.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Stay Steady with Anti-Slip Grip</strong>",
            "text": "<p><br/>The anti-slip stripes on the bottom of the socks provide extra stability and grip, preventing unwanted slipping on smooth surfaces. Designed for both home and active use, they help you stay balanced and confident whether walking, exercising, or simply moving around indoors.<br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_MQUTFn": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/896411db-2189-46e1-8bae-077f3712a007.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Padded Ankle Protection for Lasting Comfort</strong>",
            "text": "<p>The padded ankle brace at the back of the sock provides targeted protection against friction and shoe pressure. Positioned just above the heel, it cushions the ankle to prevent irritation and blisters, making the socks especially comfortable for long wear and active movement.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_4ed9wy": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/6b5a12b8-7045-4eea-bfb6-49fb57f7080d.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Everything You Need in One Sock</strong>",
            "text": "<p>Comfort padding, strong arch support, ankle protection, and a perfect fit made for long hours on your feet. Designed with premium cotton cushioning and stable support for your most comfortable step yet.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
